  "directions": "Located 5 minutes from the A34 between Cheadle and Wilmslow on the perimeter of the Bramhall Shopping Centre. There is a public car park behind us (near Sainsbury's) that is 20p per hour. Bramhall is also served well by Stagecoach bus 378 and by train from Manchester Piccadilly.",
  "reviews": [
    {
      "quote": "Thank you Ed, thank you team for always looking after me and making me shine - when I go out (with my makeup on) I feel amazing! xxx",
      "name": "Magali Gorré",
      "service": ""
    },
    {
      "quote": "This was my first Brazilian blow dry and I’m absolutely in love with it! It makes life so much easier and saves loads of time plus my hair looks fabulous and feels amazing ALL of the time! Will most definitely have it done again. The staff are so friendly and chatty, the time practically flies by! I highly recommend having this treatment done to anyone! Thanks Eds❤️",
      "name": "Abigail",
      "service": "Brazilian Blow Out"
    },
    {
      "quote": "I was at Ed's a couple of weeks ago with the amazing Denise. 💕She didn't just fix my badly dyed hair, as that was all I was hoping for after putting up with brassy, awful hair for over a month... But she totally transformed it to something I absolutely loved! She also showed me new possibilities mixing blonde with pink tones, something I'd never had the guts to do until I walked into Ed's! I loved it so much I'm going back for more In a couple of weeks, thank you everyone at Ed's, and particularly my girl Denise.  If you are debating going to this salon then get your phone out, make an appointment and get your booty there! You won't regret it... They also have prosecco :-)",
      "name": "Hannah Porter",
      "service": "BlondeMe"
    },
    {
      "quote": "If I tell you that I've been coming to Ed's for around six years now, originally at the Salford salon when it first opened, and I now travel an hour one way for a Brazillian Blow Dry, I think you will realise how amazingly talented he and his team are!! It's always a pleasure to come, and the results are unbelievably fantastic! I've gone from cork screw frizzy curls to a wash n go girl; hairdryer n straighteners are a distant memory! The atmosphere and team spirit in the salon instantly puts you at ease, everyone is so friendly but highly knowledgeable and professional. Ed's has been my secret indulgence for amazing sleek shiny and healthy hair for so long now, and it won't be changing any time soon; thanks guys, you all totally rock ;) x",
      "name": "Sara Hudson",
      "service": "Brazilian Blow Out"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Holiday hair ..ready! ✔️💁🏼 Thanks to the team @edshairsalon ...especially @markosilva ....you sir, are a genius! 🙏 💯",
      "name": "Lesley Hatton",
      "service": "Blonde Holiday Hair"
    }
  ],
